1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,038
Every second, digital banking loses millions to fraud.

2
00:00:03,988 --> 00:00:12,897
But in high-growth mobile financial ecosystems like Bangladesh, blocking honest customers costs institutions four times more.

3
00:00:12,897 --> 00:00:19,818
Legacy systems rely on static threshold rules, causing a ninety-five percent false-positive storm.

4
00:00:19,818 --> 00:00:31,397
Worse, coordinated syndicates easily bypass single-account checks by layering micro-transfers across mule rings in under four minutes—long before overnight batch jobs run.

